scene University_Parking_Empty_Day
with fade

n "It was his first real day in a long time. The old brown car slowly rolled into the university parking lot before finally coming to a stop near the entrance."

scene Car_University_Driver_Front_Day
with dissolve

n "The engine went silent, yet he remained seated with his hands resting on the steering wheel, staring through the windshield at the students moving through the gates."
n "Some were laughing with friends, others were already discussing assignments, and a few walked across the campus as if they had done it a thousand times before."

scene Car_University_Driver_Side_Day
with dissolve

mc "..."
mc "They all look like they know exactly where they're going."

n "Everything around him felt normal, almost routine, while he sat there wondering where he was supposed to fit into all of it."

mc "Meanwhile, I don't even know where my first classroom is."

mc "Ugh..."

n "He leaned back against the seat and let out a quiet sigh, hoping that somehow getting out of the car would feel easier if he waited a few more seconds."

mc "New city. New university. New major."
mc "What could possibly go wrong?"

